  {
   "id": "chef-life-a-restaurant-simulator-191698@04",
   "gameId": "chef-life-a-restaurant-simulator-191698",
   "displayName": "Patch 04",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-06-22T09:35:32.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello Chefs!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It’s with great happiness that we’re deploying a new patch! Huge improvements were made on user interfaces, quality of life, balancing and animations, as well as a lot of bug fixing, including repairing the save system, and new content!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can read below a list of the changes. There are many others that you may or may not notice, but they should make your experience on Chef Life all the better!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "IMPROVED SAVE SYSTEM",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "fixed bugs",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "optimized save file size",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "more auto-saves during the tutorial",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "new popup warning the player they'll lose progression if they quit during service",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "QUICK START",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "You can now skip the tutorial.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "SMOOTHER DAILY FLOW",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "A shortcut in the market allows you to automatically make the same food order as the previous one.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can also load the same basket as the day before.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "BETTER QUEST WORKFLOW",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "There’s now markers to quest-related recipes on the research table and recipe book.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Quest markers are displayed if a recipe needs to be leveled up to complete a quest",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can filter recipes out recipes not needed in quests",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "They're displayed on the preparation table so you now know exactly what to give to your brigade",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New feedback to show the progress of brigade members' levels",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "REWORKED THE WARMKEEPER",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Heat lamps are now a separate station from the warmkeeper",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The warmkeeper allows you to store a wider variety of dishes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "IMPROVED THE DRESSING EDITOR",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Resize all ingredients that you've already dropped",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved interface and feedback",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Only 300 personalized plating max. New feedback to find the extra plating in the editor index",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Only variants compatible with the dish are displayed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "NEW PHOTO MODE FEATURES",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "More backgrounds colours",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New decorations, with different moods",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Interface had been reworked to offer better readability",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "BETTER DIALOGUES & NPCs",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "New animations and visual effects to enhance dialogue events",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved NPC animation and camera movement when they arrive in the restaurant",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "BETTER MAPPING",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "More interfaces are now clickable (PC only)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Reworked the cutting board",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Reworked the meat slicer",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved rumble features",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tweaked controls",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "IMPROVED RECIPE BOOK",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Improved the interface for readability",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Better sorting to find recipes by their status : new, still learning able to be leveled up",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can filter recipes needed for quests",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Easily identify recipes that are currently being learnt",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The minimum/maximum grade a craft can get is displayed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Added an Accessibility menu",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Change subtitle size",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Toggle the HOLD action on mandatory inputs",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Can display longer the barks",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Display a voice indicator",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Turn off background animation during dialogues",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "In the \"preferences\" menu: select automatic techniques",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "CHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "New appearances",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New haircuts",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New beards and mustaches...",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "and above all... you can now wear glasses!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "LAYOUT AND BUILD",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Reorganized sections",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved UI",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Room capacity of each layout is clearer",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Workstation capacity is now displayed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "BOOMBOX",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Added a boombox, allowing you to change the background music.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "OTHER CHANGES",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Sous-chefs’ wheel provides information about who does what",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tags are displayed on the recipes on the research table",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Money gained is displayed on the character",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Better sorting in fridges to find food by their categories",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Better sorting on the shipping table during service",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved research table interface",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved certain workstations' visuals",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
